WEBVTT
X-TIMESTAMP-MAP=LOCAL:00:00:00.000,MPEGTS:0

00:01.632 --> 00:03.033 align:center line:81%
Brothers and sisters,

00:03.267 --> 00:09.806 align:center line:79%
can you remember a moment when someone
gave you a gift that changed your life?

00:11.708 --> 00:16.413 align:center line:79%
This October marks 40 years since I
received one of the greatest gifts

00:16.413 --> 00:20.017 align:center line:81%
in my life. While I was in high school,

00:20.017 --> 00:25.589 align:center line:79%
I noticed that one of our classmates
had a light that was different from most

00:25.589 --> 00:27.057 align:center line:81%
of the other young people.

00:27.658 --> 00:29.159 align:center line:81%
I enjoyed being around him.

00:29.893 --> 00:33.664 align:center line:79%
One day he told me he was a member
of The Church of Jesus Christ

00:33.730 --> 00:38.669 align:center line:79%
of Latter-day Saints, and then he offered
me a copy of the Book of Mormon.

00:39.369 --> 00:43.607 align:center line:79%
He invited me to read a few
pages and meet with two friends

00:43.607 --> 00:45.709 align:center line:81%
who could answer my questions.

00:46.677 --> 00:48.946 align:center line:81%
Those friends were the missionaries.

00:50.414 --> 00:54.151 align:center line:79%
When I met with the missionaries,
they taught me the doctrine of Christ,

00:54.151 --> 00:58.088 align:center line:79%
and invited me to follow the prophet’s
Moroni’s invitation:

00:58.956 --> 01:04.227 align:center line:79%
“When ye shall receive these things,
I would exhort you that ye would ask God,

01:04.595 --> 01:09.333 align:center line:79%
the Eternal Father, in the name
of Christ, if these things are not true,

01:10.067 --> 01:15.372 align:center line:79%
and if ye shall ask
with a sincere heart, with real intent,

01:15.906 --> 01:17.407 align:center line:81%
having faith in Christ,

01:17.474 --> 01:22.779 align:center line:79%
he will manifest the truth of it
unto you by the power of the Holy Ghost.”

01:23.780 --> 01:26.717 align:center line:79%
I read several pages
of the Book of Mormon and prayed.

01:27.451 --> 01:30.754 align:center line:79%
Although I did not yet
have a deep understanding

01:30.787 --> 01:34.224 align:center line:79%
of all the things that the missionaries
were teaching me,

01:34.224 --> 01:39.062 align:center line:79%
I felt in my heart
that what I was reading

01:39.096 --> 01:41.064 align:center line:81%
was good and came from God.

01:42.299 --> 01:45.435 align:center line:79%
I received the confirmation
of Moroni’s promise,

01:46.069 --> 01:50.807 align:center line:79%
“And by the power of the Holy Ghost,
ye may know the truth of all things.”

01:52.175 --> 01:56.546 align:center line:79%
After I was baptized into The Church
of Jesus Christ of Latter-day Saints,

01:56.980 --> 02:01.184 align:center line:79%
some friends tried to convince me
that I had made the wrong decision.

02:02.085 --> 02:05.856 align:center line:79%
But each time I faced
such doubts or opposition,

02:06.456 --> 02:10.827 align:center line:79%
I received renewed confirmation
through studying the scriptures

02:10.827 --> 02:16.600 align:center line:79%
and praying to stay true to the covenant
I had entered into with God.

02:17.200 --> 02:21.405 align:center line:79%
Since then, the Book of Mormon
has been my companion

02:21.838 --> 02:26.376 align:center line:79%
and has become an immeasurable treasure
in my mortal journey.

02:27.544 --> 02:29.946 align:center line:79%
The Book of Mormon is more
than just a book.

02:29.946 --> 02:31.348 align:center line:81%
It is another testament

02:31.348 --> 02:36.019 align:center line:79%
of Jesus Christ “written by many ancient
prophets through the spirit

02:36.019 --> 02:38.088 align:center line:81%
of prophecy and revelation.”

02:39.056 --> 02:41.958 align:center line:79%
The most significant
“event recorded in the Book

02:41.958 --> 02:47.964 align:center line:79%
of Mormon is the personal ministry of the
Lord Jesus Christ among the Nephites,

02:47.964 --> 02:50.367 align:center line:81%
shortly after His Resurrection.”

02:51.334 --> 02:54.705 align:center line:79%
The Book of Mormon “puts
forth the doctrine of the gospel,

02:55.305 --> 02:57.407 align:center line:81%
outlines the plan of salvation,

02:57.641 --> 03:02.446 align:center line:79%
and tells men what they must do
to gain peace in this life

03:02.779 --> 03:05.849 align:center line:79%
and eternal salvation
in the life to come.”

03:07.417 --> 03:11.588 align:center line:79%
The first edition of the Book of Mormon:
Another Testament of Jesus Christ

03:11.888 --> 03:15.525 align:center line:79%
was published in a small town
in the state of New York

03:15.525 --> 03:22.065 align:center line:79%
in March 1830. The Prophet Joseph
Smith was only 23 years old

03:22.332 --> 03:26.203 align:center line:79%
when he completed the translation
of the book in 1829.

03:27.370 --> 03:32.309 align:center line:79%
He translated almost the entire
book in less than 75 days,

03:32.309 --> 03:35.345 align:center line:79%
and the printing process
took about seven months.

03:36.480 --> 03:40.117 align:center line:79%
Today, approximately
80,000 full-time missionaries

03:40.117 --> 03:44.888 align:center line:79%
in more than 150 countries
are serving as volunteers,

03:45.455 --> 03:50.727 align:center line:79%
dedicating their lives to bearing
witness that the Book of Mormon is true

03:50.927 --> 03:53.830 align:center line:81%
and that it testifies of Jesus Christ.

03:55.031 --> 04:00.170 align:center line:79%
At the most recent seminar for new
mission leaders in June of this past year,

04:00.670 --> 04:05.408 align:center line:79%
President Russell M. Nelson shared his
powerful testimony of the Book of Mormon.

04:05.509 --> 04:09.079 align:center line:79%
Quote, “The Book of Mormon
is the word of God.

04:09.479 --> 04:11.548 align:center line:81%
It teaches the doctrine of Christ

04:11.548 --> 04:16.319 align:center line:79%
and explains more about the Savior’s
Atonement than any other book.”

04:16.353 --> 04:18.488 align:center line:81%
End quote. I would like

04:18.488 --> 04:23.827 align:center line:79%
to offer three suggestions that can help
deepen our conversion to Jesus Christ

04:24.327 --> 04:27.330 align:center line:79%
through a study
of the Book of Mormon. First,

04:27.898 --> 04:31.268 align:center line:79%
be diligent and consistent
in your daily study.

04:31.802 --> 04:34.204 align:center line:81%
Like Alma and the sons of Mosiah, we

04:34.604 --> 04:39.409 align:center line:79%
must “[search] the scriptures diligently
that we might know the word of God”

04:39.442 --> 04:41.678 align:center line:81%
and be strengthened in the truth.

04:42.913 --> 04:46.817 align:center line:79%
While serving as mission leaders
in the Georgia Atlanta Mission,

04:47.150 --> 04:51.288 align:center line:79%
we encouraged every missionary
to study the Book of Mormon for

04:51.555 --> 04:53.290 align:center line:81%
at least 30 minutes daily.

04:54.124 --> 05:00.030 align:center line:79%
That commitment increased our faith
and helped us to seek and expect miracles.

05:01.031 --> 05:03.066 align:center line:81%
It is possible that after the mission,

05:03.733 --> 05:08.605 align:center line:79%
we may not have the same amount of time
available for daily scripture study.

05:08.605 --> 05:14.177 align:center line:79%
But I promise that if you sincerely
prioritize your studying the Book

05:14.177 --> 05:19.850 align:center line:79%
of Mormon prayerfully each day you
will find great spiritual strength

05:20.016 --> 05:22.853 align:center line:79%
and confidence in the Lord
and His promises.

05:23.920 --> 05:27.757 align:center line:79%
The second suggestion is make
your study more meaningful by

05:27.791 --> 05:29.993 align:center line:81%
feasting upon the words of Christ.

05:31.027 --> 05:34.798 align:center line:79%
Nephi taught: “Feast
upon the words of Christ;

05:35.131 --> 05:39.836 align:center line:79%
for behold, the words of Christ
will tell you all things

05:40.270 --> 05:41.404 align:center line:81%
what ye should do.”

05:42.606 --> 05:45.475 align:center line:81%
To feast means more than just reading.

05:45.742 --> 05:50.080 align:center line:79%
It means savoring,
pondering, and applying.

05:50.714 --> 05:52.549 align:center line:81%
As you study the Book of Mormon,

05:52.549 --> 05:56.519 align:center line:79%
consider ways to make
your study more meaningful.

05:56.720 --> 06:02.425 align:center line:79%
For example, use study aids
available in the Gospel Library app.

06:03.026 --> 06:09.766 align:center line:79%
Identify eternal truths that help us
understand God's plan and lead us to make

06:09.766 --> 06:12.269 align:center line:79%
and keep covenants
with our Heavenly Father.

06:12.836 --> 06:15.438 align:center line:81%
And highlight significant phrases

06:15.438 --> 06:17.741 align:center line:81%
and record your impressions

06:17.741 --> 06:20.777 align:center line:79%
to preserve what you have learned
during your study.

06:21.945 --> 06:26.416 align:center line:79%
The Book of Mormon has the power
to answer questions of our souls.

06:27.017 --> 06:33.223 align:center line:79%
As Nephi said, we should “liken all
scriptures unto us that it might be

06:33.223 --> 06:38.194 align:center line:79%
for our profit and learning.”
As we feast upon the words of Christ,

06:38.628 --> 06:44.000 align:center line:79%
they will open the door to revelation
and show us what we need to do

06:44.401 --> 06:48.672 align:center line:79%
in the various circumstances
of our life to draw close to Him.

06:49.639 --> 06:51.074 align:center line:81%
The third suggestion:

06:51.474 --> 06:55.111 align:center line:79%
Bear your testimony of the truthfulness
of the Book of Mormon.

06:55.879 --> 07:01.284 align:center line:79%
Just as Lehi desired to share the fruit
of the tree of life with his family,

07:01.818 --> 07:04.621 align:center line:79%
when we gain a testimony
of the Book of Mormon,

07:04.621 --> 07:09.192 align:center line:79%
we develop a desire to share
the joy that comes from knowing

07:09.225 --> 07:11.027 align:center line:81%
the gospel of Jesus Christ.

07:12.228 --> 07:18.368 align:center line:79%
One of our missionaries, Sister Benson,
who is attending with us this session,

07:20.003 --> 07:23.239 align:center line:79%
shared with me her desire
to help her young brother.

07:23.673 --> 07:27.444 align:center line:79%
At that time, he was preparing
to attend college

07:27.444 --> 07:29.746 align:center line:81%
and wasn't sure about serving a mission.

07:30.847 --> 07:35.986 align:center line:79%
I felt impressed to invite Sister Benson
to read the Book of Mormon

07:36.953 --> 07:39.389 align:center line:79%
during the first four months
of her mission,

07:39.923 --> 07:45.028 align:center line:79%
marking her favorite verses, and then
send that copy to her brother.

07:46.629 --> 07:50.166 align:center line:79%
Sister Benson sent that marked copy
of the Book of Mormon and

07:50.233 --> 07:55.171 align:center line:79%
invited her brother
to read from it each night.

07:55.905 --> 07:59.175 align:center line:79%
She later shared
with me, “Before my mission,

07:59.676 --> 08:03.179 align:center line:79%
my brother wasn’t sure if he wanted
to serve a full-time mission.

08:03.580 --> 08:07.450 align:center line:79%
Slowly, over time,
as he read the Book of Mormon,

08:07.517 --> 08:12.989 align:center line:79%
he found increasing joy in his life
and began to consider serving mission.”

08:14.024 --> 08:15.258 align:center line:81%
Two weeks before

08:16.292 --> 08:18.328 align:center line:81%
Sister Benson completed her mission,

08:19.662 --> 08:22.132 align:center line:81%
her brother received his mission call.

08:23.299 --> 08:27.771 align:center line:79%
He is now serving in the Mexico
Tuxtla Gutierrez Mission.

08:28.738 --> 08:30.106 align:center line:81%
Through the Book of Mormon,

08:30.140 --> 08:33.977 align:center line:79%
Elder Benson came to see his life
with spiritual clarity,

08:34.744 --> 08:36.813 align:center line:81%
which led him to serve the Lord

08:36.813 --> 08:41.785 align:center line:79%
and trust that things would work
out. That decision was a miracle

08:41.785 --> 08:44.554 align:center line:79%
influenced by the power
of the words of Christ.

08:45.388 --> 08:47.424 align:center line:81%
My beloved brothers and sisters,

08:47.757 --> 08:52.462 align:center line:79%
I encourage each of you to deepen
your study of the Book of Mormon.

08:53.196 --> 08:57.734 align:center line:79%
I know as we feast upon the words
of Christ found in the Book of Mormon,

08:58.334 --> 09:02.038 align:center line:79%
the Spirit will help us
understand eternal truths

09:02.038 --> 09:05.909 align:center line:79%
and share our testimony
with conviction to those

09:05.909 --> 09:08.778 align:center line:79%
who the Lord has prepared
to hear His message.

09:09.579 --> 09:15.218 align:center line:79%
The Lord said, “My elect hear
my voice and harden not their hearts.”

09:15.785 --> 09:22.492 align:center line:79%
I testify that those who ask God in faith
will gain a testimony of the truth

09:22.792 --> 09:27.397 align:center line:79%
and divinity of the Book of Mormon,
by the power of the Holy Ghost.

09:27.897 --> 09:31.768 align:center line:79%
Of this I testify
in the name of Jesus Christ, amen.

